# Stack

- **.NET 8** (`net8.0`), ASP.NET Core WebAPI
- **EF Core 8** + **Npgsql** / PostgreSQL
- **JWT Bearer** auth on API controllers
- **AutoMapper**, **Serilog**, **Swashbuckle**, **Newtonsoft.Json** on MVC
- Local secrets: `DotNetEnv` loads env in DEBUG (`Program.CreateHostBuilder`); never commit real `AI_API_KEY` values
- Outbound mail: **MailKit** via `IEmailSender` → Gmail `smtp.gmail.com:587` (STARTTLS). `HostEmail` is the Gmail address; `HostEmailPassword` / `HOST_EMAIL_PASSWORD` must be a Google App Password when 2FA is on
- Migrations live in `SET.DAL/Migrations` (namespace `SET.DataAccess.Migrations`)

## Common commands

```bash
# from backend/
dotnet build Mentor.SET.Backend.sln
dotnet test SET.UnitTests/SET.UnitTests.csproj
dotnet ef migrations add <Name> --project SET.DAL --startup-project SET.WebAPI
dotnet ef database update --project SET.DAL --startup-project SET.WebAPI
```
